        <object label="⚠ AiBroker.adapter&#10;coach · NodeJS" Purpose="Self-healing broker that synthesizes a patch with a local GGUF model and applies it." ViolationType="CROSS-SOVEREIGN SOURCE-WRITE + LIVE HOT-SWAP + FORBIDDEN Function() + HARDCODED PATHS" Severity="Critical" ExpectedRule="Sovereignty 2.2 (no module mutates another sovereign source/state; communicate via manifest/EventBus/StateStore); ProbationOfficer FORBIDDEN_STRINGS bans Function()/eval; mutations must pass ProbationOfficer sandbox + Registrar fielding before going live; Placement 7.3 (no machine-absolute paths)." ActualBehavior="fs.writeFileSync rewrites Evaluator.service.ts on disk (line 260) and monkey-patches the live registry instance evaluate() (lines 268-274) WITHOUT ProbationOfficer; uses Function('return import(...)') dynamic import; hardcodes C:\protoai\models and file:///C:/protoai GGUF paths; evaluatorPath src/services/... drifts from canonical substrate/services." FixItAction="Route the synthesized patch through Coach -> ProbationOfficer.run(source) -> Registrar.fieldChampion (hot-swap only after analysisPassed); never write peer source directly; replace Function(import) with a declared PolyglotBridge/await import; resolve paths via PathResolver." id="aibroker"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#7a1f1f;strokeColor=#ff1f1f;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="720" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
        <object label="⚠ AiProvider.adapter&#10;savant · NodeJS" Purpose="Unified LLM gateway (OpenRouter/Anthropic/OpenAI/local) with fallback, streaming, Chronicle recording." ViolationType="HARDCODED ABSOLUTE PATH + OVERLAPPING PROVIDER PATHS" Severity="Medium" ExpectedRule="Placement 7.3 (config paths via PathResolver/sovereign data dir); single-responsibility / dedup 9.1 (one provider-transport sovereign)." ActualBehavior="Hardcodes C:\protoai\data\settings.json; duplicates provider-call logic also present in LlmBridge + LlmConnector.adapter." FixItAction="Resolve settings via PathResolver/SettingsManager; consolidate provider transport into one sovereign and have others require[] it." id="aiprovider"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8a6a1f;strokeColor=#ffb000;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="720" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
        <object label="Cartographer.workflow&#10;savant · NodeJS" Purpose="Drift Map emitter: builds dependency + event graph as JSON/SVG; diff() surfaces architectural drift." id="cartographer"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#284b8a;strokeColor=#1a3360;fontColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;spacing=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="720" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
